      "metaHtml": "<p><strong>Time:</strong> 2 h 30 m · <strong>Tools today:</strong> Canva, your camera, Notes, Pinterest</p>\n<p><strong>You need:</strong> your phone, a notebook and a pen, and five real designs you can photograph or screenshot</p>",
