          "id": "practical-questions",
          "title": "Practical questions",
          "html": "<ol><li>Why is \"almost balanced\" worse than clearly asymmetrical?</li><li>What three tools create hierarchy, and which one should you try first when a design feels flat?</li><li>A client wants the logo bigger, the phone number bigger, the prices bigger and the headline bigger. What's the professional response?</li><li>Explain the four-box test and what it tells you.</li><li>Why is centring paragraphs a beginner's habit, and when is centred text genuinely correct?</li><li>What is a safe zone, and give one social media example and one print example.</li></ol>"
