          "id": "why-this-matters",
          "title": "Why this matters",
          "html": "<p>Nine out of ten design jobs involve a photo you didn't take, or a photo you have to take because the client's is unusable. If you can rescue a bad photo and shoot a clean product shot with a phone and a window, you can charge for something most local designers cannot do — and your layouts stop depending on stock photos of strangers.</p>\n<p>Today also closes Week 1's foundation and opens the capstone. From tomorrow, every skill lands on one real brand. Choose it today.</p>"
