          "html": "<ul><li>Choose the right type of mark for a business and justify it.</li><li>Run the sketch-first process and generate quantity before quality.</li><li>Build a mark from geometric shapes and type on a phone, with correct optical tuning.</li><li>Test a logo at 16 px, one colour, reversed, and on a busy background.</li><li>Present three concepts to a client and defend one recommendation.</li></ul>"
