          "html": "<ol><li>Why is batching faster than making posts one at a time, even though the total design work is the same?</li><li>What must be locked in a template, and what must stay open?</li><li>Why does a carousel need a different structure from a single post?</li><li>Explain \"ease\" to someone who has never animated anything, and why linear movement looks cheap.</li><li>Your animated post looks fine on the canvas but bad in the app. Name three likely causes.</li><li>A client wants fifteen posts a month for the price of five. What are your two honest options?</li></ol>"
