        "html": "<pre><code>DAY __  ·  DATE ______\nGoal (one sentence):\n\nWhat I made (files saved where):\n\nWhat worked (a mechanism, not a feeling):\n\nWhat I&#x27;d change (be specific):\n\nScore /12 (purpose / hierarchy / craft / fitness):\n   ___ / ___ / ___ / ___  =  ___\n\nResearch for tomorrow (copy from the day&#x27;s last section):\n[ ]\n[ ]\n[ ]</code></pre>"
