        "html": "<pre><code>GD/\n├── 01-Research/           screenshots, references, inspiration\n├── 02-Work-in-progress/   versions, sketches, experiments\n├── 03-Final/              exported, client-ready files\n└── Design-Log/            daily entries, briefs, notes\n\nFile name:   day07-capstone-logo-v3.png\n             project-asset-version.extension\nNever:       IMG_20261027_1(2).png</code></pre>\n<p>Keep every version until the project closes. Clients change their minds backwards, and \"v2 was better\" is a real sentence you will hear.</p>"
